<div class="wp-block-group ok-trow"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"anchor":"evening-certificate","className":"ok-trow__h"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading ok-trow__h" id="evening-certificate">Evening Certificate in Banquet Service</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:group {"className":"ok-trow__b","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group ok-trow__b"><!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"ok-copy"} -->
<p class="ok-copy">In addition to our full-time diploma, Okami College offers the Evening Certificate in Banquet Service for working individuals seeking focused hospitality credentials. This practical course runs for ten weeks, meeting two evenings a week inside the banquet room and restaurant of Okami House. Taught by Amara Okonkwo, the curriculum covers banquet table layout, formal beverage service, event timing, and client hosting. Tuition for the ten-week certificate is €1,250, providing direct access to our professional facilities and industry-standard training equipment. Participants graduate with hands-on banquet competence recognized across event venues and luxury properties.</p>
